HNi32qf7gHQgdZpeYb-5LUAUzVz-UDR3HDuxiVbNAfFNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx2vgUvAAFcYNmCkupaaVStQlXMsQhmGuCGtSI3yLk4rA&oe=69B6B855"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_03.png", "id": "1078013840882615", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499356638_1078013844215948_4431526408350712785_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F-vxLHqm-sMQ7kNvwFpJ2it&_nc_oc=AdlQoTFeb-KWpyD0fmQzCUi48ngEU-cSwN0oGdSsyvimRCTMJtpIxUzuV6DTRFdcu0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxZPBfpfMv85U-yZgEGNolsJW9bm3pAIUK3Ew3wDDGB1A&oe=69B6A90E"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_01.png", "id": "548187144806946", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324048_548187148140279_302708763491369627_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A1Oobvvq_e0Q7kNvwEuLKwN&_nc_oc=AdngTDuq9UTTs6EKNIPtjaefOeOGLTDu8dxnxIoAM0tjaf67fcNMf0kI8dnSLei9-g0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxp_DsVc2EyVoNR6KDgdbNBW-hs4TV3w_CQnkbETxlxIw&oe=69B6A974"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_05.png", "id": "1416446512843773", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324939_1416446516177106_7952489805788314366_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g2NPDpEtGNUQ7kNvwF-Mhw8&_nc_oc=AdlVrhI8c1idDzYi3FwolvwTqs6TABXMHc9H_negKJAVFZYFPEwq5S2X5JPanlKg0qM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyOn9t9SbbeC1Uy9GQ4JfdxP3qvKUpGfCUrOqfLh7micw&oe=69B68DBA"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_06.png", "id": "1188825093024789", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499333143_1188825096358122_7698089225442683365_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OzM07bai_mAQ7kNvwH_FrIs&_nc_oc=Adn9CX4EoLlKTGJOgrKDBURFLYHQd_WoYDUShSMX_56j1XeaaTYf_Sujoq7PEI6pFhk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxlR9QjU7aCU90O6LIG_7elHwdIDTtPn5ittXy93nmZlg&oe=69B6A5D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "V8 Engine Simulation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock the mysteries of automotive engineering with our cutting-edge V8 Engine Training Simulator. Immerse yourself in a virtual world where learning meets hands-on experience, allowing enthusiasts, students, and professionals to grasp the intricacies of V8 engine assembly like never before.\n\nPowered by state-of-the-art technology, our simulator utilises a real V8 engine model, providing an authentic and comprehensive learning experience. Whether you're a novice eager to explore the mechanics or a seasoned automotive enthusiast aiming to enhance your knowledge, our simulator caters to all skill levels.\n\nKey Features:\n\n1. Real Engine Integration: Our simulator boasts a genuine V8 engine, enabling users to interact with real components and understand their functions.\n\n2. Interactive Learning Modules: Dive into an array of interactive modules that cover every aspect of V8 engine assembly, from identifying parts to mastering the intricacies of fuel injection systems.\n\n3. Real-Time Feedback: Receive instant feedback on your assembly progress, allowing for continuous improvement and a deeper understanding of the engine's inner workings.\n\n4. Step-by-Step Tutorials: Guided by detailed step-by-step tutorials, users can progress at their own pace, ensuring a thorough grasp of each assembly stage.\n\n\n\n\nUnleash your passion for engines and master the art of V8 assembly like never before!\n", "short_description": "Discover the art of V8 engine assembly with our state-of-the-art Training Simulator! Featuring a real V8 engine, interactive modules, and step-by-step tutorials, our simulator caters to all skill levels. Gain hands-on experience, receive real-time feedback, and master the intricacies of automotive engineering. Elevate your knowledge with our immersive and authentic V8 Engine Training Simulator today! \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pastelcube.com/privacy-pol